of their metadata

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:09.710
and all their release history.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:11.460
So there are quite a
few features in there

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:13.710
that could be
interesting for R users

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:16.620
